Your god *isn't* ignoring you.  He heard you.  He's annoyed with you.
So he decides that you're going to sit there doing the prayer thing for
the usual span.  It's the first part of the penalty for excessive
demands for divine intervention.

Also, changing low HP to minor instead of major, as you mentioned as a
possibility, would mean it *wouldn't get fixed reliably*.  ISTR that if
you have zero luck, minor troubles don't get fixed.

